{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_http_module", "label": "HTTP-Modul", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Getrennt von den I/O-Broker-Actors, weil HTTP-Server nicht in die Form 'eine Verbindung, viele Nachrichten' passen; deshalb eine eigene Route-DSL und Backend-Abstraktion, gebaut als Extension statt auf BrokerActor.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_route_dsl", "label": "Route-DSL (Uebersicht)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_marshaller", "label": "Marshaller", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpserverbackend", "label": "HttpServerBackend", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Alle drei Backends implementieren dasselbe Interface \u2014 die Route-DSL kompiliert identisch, das Backend besitzt nur die Listen- und Dispatch-Schleife.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_fastifybackend", "label": "FastifyBackend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_expressbackend", "label": "ExpressBackend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_honobackend", "label": "HonoBackend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpclient", "label": "HTTP-Client", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpclientoptions", "label": "HttpClientOptions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_client_bounds", "label": "Schranken jedes Client-Aufrufs", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Eine Antwort wird vor der Rueckgabe im Speicher gepuffert, also entscheidet sonst die Gegenstelle ueber den Heap: 30 s Deadline, 8 MiB Body, 5 Redirect-Hops. Jede Schranke wird ueber einen Vergleich durchgesetzt und ein NaN verliert jeden Vergleich lautlos, deshalb wirft ein Wert ausserhalb des Bereichs OptionsError, bevor ein Socket geoeffnet wird.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_redirect_policy", "label": "Redirect-Politik des HTTP-Clients", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Der Client folgt Redirects selbst, damit die Entscheidungen zwischen den Hops fallen: authorization/cookie/proxy-authorization fallen beim Origin-Wechsel weg, ein 303 (und 301/302 nach POST) laeuft als GET weiter, Nicht-http(s)-Ziele werden abgelehnt. Abgelehnt wird, bevor der Hop abgesetzt wird \u2014 das Absetzen selbst ist der zu verhindernde Seiteneffekt.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpresponsetoolargeerror", "label": "HttpResponseTooLargeError", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpextensionid", "label": "HttpExtensionId", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_middleware_own_cache", "label": "Jede Middleware bekommt ihren eigenen Cache", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "InMemoryCache ist LRU-begrenzt und seine Eviction ist blind dafuer, was ein Eintrag schuetzt. Bei geteilter Instanz evictet ein Aufrufer, der den Response-Cache-Key oder den Idempotency-Key variiert, die Rate-Limit-Zaehler und Idempotency-Records anderer Clients.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_thin_handler_pattern", "label": "HTTP-Handler als duenner Actor-Adapter", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Request parsen, einen Actor fragen, die Antwort marshallen. Business-Logik bleibt in Actors, weil ein langsamer Handler die Lebenszeit einer Verbindung belegt und genug davon dem Server die Kapazitaet nehmen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_no_shared_state_in_handlers", "label": "Kein geteilter State in Routen-Handlern", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Routen-Handler koennen parallel laufen; einfacher veraenderlicher State ausserhalb von Actors verursacht dieselben Races wie sonst ueberall in JavaScript.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_http_module", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_route_dsl", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_http_module", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_marshaller", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_http_module", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpserverbackend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_fastifybackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpserverbackend", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_expressbackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpserverbackend", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overv